OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with occasional
OL,6,Flight and patchy rain. Best of any dry
OL,7,Fand bright spells most likely in the
OL,8,Fmiddle part of the day across eastern
OL,9,Fareas.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy this evening with a
OL,12,Ffew spots of light rain or drizzle.
OL,13,FThen mainly dry overnight, remaining
OL,14,Flargely cloudy but with a few clearer
OL,15,Fspells possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
